# Agent-AI

A collection of practical **Agentic AI, Generative AI, RAG, and AI Automation projects** built using Python, n8n, OpenAI, Pinecone, Google services, and workflow automation.

These projects focus on solving real-world problems using AI Agents, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), vector databases, document processing, automated decision-making, and business workflow automation.

---

## 🚀 Projects

This repository currently contains the following projects:

1. **AI Customer Support Agent using RAG**
2. **AI Resume Screening & Candidate Ranking**

---

# 1. 🤖 AI Customer Support Agent using RAG

An AI-powered customer support chatbot built using **n8n, OpenAI, Pinecone, Google Drive, and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)**.

The system allows users to ask questions about documents stored in a knowledge base. Documents are processed, converted into embeddings, stored in Pinecone, and retrieved by an AI Agent when answering user questions.

---

## 🎯 Problem Statement

Traditional customer support systems often require users to search through documentation or wait for a support representative.

This project uses RAG to create an AI Customer Support Agent that can retrieve relevant information from company documents and generate natural-language answers.

---

